<p>How to save those wet, damaged books? The question has to be asked. Above, you can watch a visual primer from the <a href="https://library.syr.edu/">Syracuse University Libraries—</a>people who know something about taking care of books. It contains a series of tips, some intuitive, some less so, that will give you a clear action plan the next time water and paper meet.</p>
